# Ignore everything in this directory except the README, this file, and
# the Docker recipe (TASK-0285) -- Dockerfile is tracked. The fetched
# release payload (jars/models/docs under p2rank_2.5.1/) stays ignored,
# except its own `prank` launcher script, which is REPLACED by the
# Docker wrapper and must be tracked -- un-ignoring a file inside an
# otherwise-ignored directory requires un-ignoring the directory itself
# first (a real gitignore gotcha, not obvious from the pattern alone).
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!Dockerfile
!p2rank_2.5.1/
p2rank_2.5.1/*
!p2rank_2.5.1/prank
